<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>실습 일정 관리 | Nurse Mate</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <aside class="sidebar">
            <h2>Nurse Mate</h2>
            <nav>
    <a href="/">대시보드</a>
    <a href="/skills">간호 술기 학습</a>
    <a href="/clinical-logs">임상실습 기록</a>
    <a href="/checklist">학습 체크리스트</a>
    <a href="/practice-schedules">실습 일정 관리</a>
    <a href="/quiz">간호 퀴즈</a>
    <a href="/medical-terms">의학용어 사전</a>
    <a href="/logout">로그아웃</a>
</nav>
        </aside>

        <main class="main-content">
            <h1>실습 일정 관리</h1>
            <p>실습 일정과 주요 활동을 기록하고 관리해 보세요.</p>

            <section class="card">
                <h2>새 일정 등록</h2>

                <form action="/practice-schedules" method="POST">
                    <label>일정 제목</label>
                    <input type="text" name="title"
                           placeholder="예: 성인간호학 실습" required>

                    <label>실습 날짜</label>
                    <input type="date" name="practice_date" required>

                    <label>시작 시간</label>
                    <input type="time" name="start_time">

                    <label>종료 시간</label>
                    <input type="time" name="end_time">

                    <label>실습 장소</label>
                    <input type="text" name="location"
                           placeholder="예: 병원명 또는 병동">

                    <label>메모</label>
                    <textarea name="memo"
                              placeholder="준비물이나 주요 활동을 입력하세요."></textarea>

                    <button type="submit">일정 등록하기</button>
                </form>
            </section>

            <section class="card">
                <h2>등록된 실습 일정</h2>

                <% if (schedules.length === 0) { %>
                    <p>등록된 일정이 없습니다.</p>
                <% } else { %>
                    <% schedules.forEach(schedule => { %>
                        <div class="schedule-item">
                            <h3><%= schedule.title %></h3>
                            <p>날짜: <%= new Date(schedule.practice_date).toLocaleDateString('ko-KR', { timeZone: 'UTC' }) %></p>
                            <p>
                                시간:
                                <%= schedule.start_time || '미정' %>
                                ~
                                <%= schedule.end_time || '미정' %>
                            </p>
                            <p>장소: <%= schedule.location || '미입력' %></p>
                            <p>메모: <%= schedule.memo || '없음' %></p>

                            <form action="/practice-schedules/<%= schedule.id %>/delete"
                                  method="POST">
                                <button type="submit">삭제</button>
                            </form>
                        </div>
                    <% }) %>
                <% } %>
            </section>
        </main>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
